# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key. .env is gitignored — it is
# never committed. Only used by `npm run translate` and `npm run translate:content`
# (see scripts/lib/deepl.mjs); the site build never reads it and stays hermetic.

# DeepL API key, for the translation pipeline. Get one at
# https://www.deepl.com/pro-api — the free tier's 1,000,000 chars/month is
# plenty for this club's volume (see PLAN.md §4). A free-tier key ends in
# ":fx"; scripts/lib/deepl.mjs routes it to the free endpoint automatically.
#
# Replaced ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (2026-08, board decision — PLAN.md §4): that key
# was billed per token to whoever is currently president, and the club must
# not depend on a personal card. DeepL translates one string at a time, using
# its `context` parameter to carry what disambiguates it; see the comment at
# the top of scripts/translate.mjs for what that trades away and how
# scripts/lib/validate.mjs covers for it.
DEEPL_API_KEY=
